      "text": "Consumers use offsets to read messages (kinda acts like pagination token), \nalso helps with reading the message only once, when multiple consumers \nworking within the same consumer group.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Consumers use offsets to read messages (kinda acts like pagination token), \nalso helps with reading the message only once, when multiple consumers \nworking within the same consumer group.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
