      "updated": 1773926478394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "* Each partition is designed a leader replica on 1 of the brokers, it is also responsible for handling read and write operations to the partition.\n* Assignment for reader replica is managed centrally for some cluster controller, which makes sure that all the leader replicas are effectively distributed across the cluster.  \n* The followers don't handle client requests, Each follower just passively replicates the data from the leader. Effectively acting like a backup, ready to take over if leader, for some reason, goes down.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "* Each partition is designed a leader replica on 1 of the brokers, it is also responsible for handling read and write operations to the partition.\n* Assignment for reader replica is managed centrally for some cluster controller, which makes sure that all the leader replicas are effectively distributed across the cluster.  \n* The followers don't handle client requests, Each follower just passively replicates the data from the leader. Effectively acting like a backup, ready to take over if leader, for some reason, goes down.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
